#. "L_PAM_004"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_PAM_005"
msgid "Reactivate teleportals\n"
msgstr "Réactiver téléporteurs\n"

#. "L_PAM_006"
msgid "Disable Cetan megaweapon\n"
msgstr "Neutraliser Super-Arme Cetan\n"

#. "L_PAM_007"
msgid "Secure control room\n"
msgstr "Sécuriser la Salle de Contrôle\n"

#. "L_PAM_008"
msgid "Restore Dr. Caroll's personality\n"
msgstr "Restaurer la personnalité du Dr. Caroll\n"

#. "L_PAM_009"
msgid "Escape from Cetan ship\n"
msgstr "S'échapper du vaisseau cetan\n"

#. "L_PAM_010"
msgid ""
"This will help us to get round the \n"
"ship quicker.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cela nous aidera à nous déplacer plus\n"
" vite dans ce vaisseau.\n"

#. "L_PAM_011"
msgid ""
"This antibody masking will protect us from \n"
"the automatic defenses.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce camouflage corporel nous aidera à nous \n"
"protéger des défenses automatiques.\n"

#. "L_PAM_012"
msgid ""
"There's Dr. Caroll. Let's see if we can \n"
"reverse what was done to him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Voilà le Dr. Caroll. Voyons voir si nous \n"
"pouvons inverser le processus.\n"

#. "L_PAM_013"
msgid "We have to get out of here!\n"
msgstr "On doit se barrer d'ici!\n"

#. "L_PAM_014"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis a été tué.\n"

#. "L_PAM_015"
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll a été tué.\n"

#. "L_PAM_016"
msgid "Cetan ship evacuation successful.\n"
msgstr "Evacuation du vaisseau Cetan réussie.\n"

#. "L_PAM_017"
msgid "Elvis has unlocked the door.\n"
msgstr "Elvis a déverrouillé la porte.\n"

#. "L_PAM_018"
msgid ""
"Here, take this gun and keep those Skedar \n"
"off my back while I'm working.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiens, prends cette arme et tiens ces Skedars à distance pendant que je "
"travaille.\n"

#. "L_PAM_019"
msgid "Antibody masking has been obtained.\n"
msgstr "Camouflage corporel obtenu.\n"

#. "L_PAM_020"
msgid "Cetan megaweapon has been disabled.\n"
msgstr "Super-Arme Cetan neutralisée.\n"

#. "L_PAM_021"
msgid "Control Room has been secured.\n"
msgstr "Salle de Contrôle sécurisée.\n"

#. "L_PAM_022"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's personality has been restored.\n"
msgstr " Personnalité du Dr. Caroll restaurée.\n"

#. "L_PAM_023"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_PAM_024"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_PAM_025"
msgid "Backup disk\n"
msgstr "Disque sauvegarde\n"

#. "L_PAM_026"
msgid "A backup disk\n"
msgstr "Un disque sauvegarde \n"

#. "L_PAM_027"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_PAM_028"
msgid ""
"It looks like this could benefit from \n"
"a little bit of sabotage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Un peu de sabotage ne ferait pas de mal\n"
" à ce truc.\n"

#. "L_PAM_029"
msgid "Time to reactivate those teleportals.\n"
msgstr "Il est temps de réactiver ces téléporteurs.\n"

#. "L_PAM_030"
msgid "Teleportals have been reactivated.\n"
msgstr "Téléporteurs réactivés.\n"

#. "L_PAM_031"
msgid "This doesn't seem normal. No one's around.\n"
msgstr "C'est bizarre, il n'y a personne dans le coin.\n"

#. "L_PAM_032"
msgid "No signs of conflict. No spent ammo cases or bullet holes.\n"
msgstr "Pas de traces de combat. Pas de douilles ou d'impacts d'armes à feu.\n"

#. "L_PAM_033"
msgid "But there ought to be a rear guard at least. It makes no sense.\n"
msgstr "Ca n'a pas de sens. Il devrait au moins y avoir une arrière-garde.\n"

#. "L_PAM_034"
msgid "There has to be someone farther inside. Cover me.\n"
msgstr "Il doit y avoir quelqu'un plus loin. Couvre-moi.\n"

#. "L_PAM_035"
msgid ""
"Here goes. I just hope dataDyne haven't done anything to prevent this...\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est parti... J'espère que la dataDyne n'a rien prévu pour empêcher ça...\n"

#. "L_PAM_036"
msgid "Virus detected.\n"
msgstr "Virus détecté.\n"

#. "L_PAM_037"
msgid "Me and my big mouth.\n"
msgstr "Ca m'apprendra, tiens...\n"

#. "L_PAM_038"
msgid ""
"Commencing countermeasures. Commenc..... *** ooOOoh!! *** eeEEe!! *** "
"aaAhh!! *** oOOoh!! *** aAArRrgghh!! *** YEEeeooOOOOOOowWWwlll!! ***\n"
msgstr ""
"Lancement des contre-mesures. Lancem...***ooOOoh!!***aaAAh!!***aaAAAhh!! "
"***ooOOoh!!***YaaAAAhh!!***YEEAaAaAaAAAaAAaAHHH!!***\n"

#. "L_PAM_039"
msgid "Dr. Caroll? Are you in control again? Can you stop the program?\n"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Caroll? Avez-vous repris le contrôle? Pouvez-vous arrêter le "
"programme?\n"

#. "L_PAM_040"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm back again, my dear. But the program has run far too long for me to"
" prevent it from completing. There is only one way out now.\n"
msgstr ""
"En effet, me voilà de retour, très chère. Le programme est lancé depuis trop"
" longtemps pour que je puisse l'arrêter. Il n'y a qu'une seule issue "
"maintenant.\n"

#. "L_PAM_041"
msgid "What do you mean?\n"
msgstr "Que voulez-vous dire?\n"

#. "L_PAM_042"
msgid ""
"When the program has run, I will have control of a vastly powerful weapon. "
"It cannot be allowed to exist. So I must destroy the Cetan and, "
"unfortunately, myself along with it. I'm sorry, Joanna... There is no other "
"way and no time to discuss this. Go now - avoid the Skedar and you will have"
" time to escape. It has been an honor to work with you. Goodbye, Joanna "
"Dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"Quand le programme sera terminé, j'aurai le contrôle d'une arme extrêmement "
"puissante. Cette arme ne doit pas exister. Je dois par conséquent détruire "
"le vaisseau cetan et moi avec, malheureusement. Joanna... Nous n'avons ni le"
" choix ni le temps d'en discuter. Allez-y! Evitez les Skedars et vous aurez "
"le temps de vous échapper. Ce fut un honneur de  travailler avec vous. "
"Adieu, Joanna Dark.\n"

#. "L_PAM_043"
msgid "Cetan megaweapon has been disabled.\n"
msgstr "La Super-Arme Cetan a été neutralisée.\n"

#. "L_PAM_044"
msgid "Ammo wasted - unable to disable megaweapon.\n"
msgstr "Munitions épuisées - arme ennemie ne peut être détruite.\n"
